{
  "comment": "Why: the astral sectors are an observatory, so their encounters are rare (roll bonus minus one) and sharp (budget scale 1.2): few bodies, each with a trick. The cultists are the astronomers, the vexes their conjured lights, the shulkers watch from the walls, the orrery guards itself, and the mimic is a case whose armour left its display.",
